<div class="col-sm-12 not-editable">
    <p>Physical object settings can not be edited here. These fields are associated with the parent media
<%= link_to(@presenter.direct_parent_first_member.link_name, contextual_path(@presenter.direct_parent_first_member, @presenter)) %>. <br />
To change these settings, edit the parent media.</p>
</div>

